by the Board. The Committee shall review the policy annually.
(4) The TC shall act in accordance with the terms of reference specified in writing by the Board
which shall, inter alia, include but is not limited to (a) Guide in preparation of IT Strategy and ensure that the IT Strategy aligns with the
overall strategy of the CCP towards accomplishment of its business objectives;
(b) Satisfy itself that the IT Governance and Information Security Governance structure
