(iv) ensuring either by itself or through its Committee that there is no conflict of interest arising out of third-party engagements, especially when permitting an exception to the requirement that the service provider of outsourced services, if not a group company, shall not be owned or controlled by any director, key managerial personnel, approver of the outsourcing arrangement, or their relatives as indicated under the proviso to paragraph 12(vi) of these Directions; and
