44. Accounts of Politically Exposed Persons (PEPs):
(1) The ARC shall have the option of establishing a relationship with PEPs (whether as customer or beneficial owner) provided that, apart from performing normal customer due diligence:
(i) the ARC has in place appropriate risk management systems to determine whether the customer or the beneficial owner is a PEP;
