(vi) The net delta-based equivalent of the total book of foreign currency options.
Foreign exchange open positions and gold open positions are at present risk-weighted at 100 per cent. The open positions, limits or actual whichever is higher, shall attract capital charge at 9 per cent. This capital charge is in addition to the capital charge for credit risk on the on-balance sheet and off-balance sheet items pertaining to foreign exchange and gold transactions.
