34. The following are the illustrative measures that could be taken by the lenders for monitoring and ensuring end-use of funds:
(1) Meaningful scrutiny of quarterly progress reports / operating statements / balance sheets of the borrowers;
(2) Regular inspection of borrowers' assets charged to the lenders as security;
(3) Periodic scrutiny of borrowers' books of accounts and the no-lien accounts maintained with other banks;
(4) Periodic visits to the assisted units;
