(3) Notwithstanding sub-paragraph (2) above, considering the difficulties of large borrowers, stock statements relied upon by a bank for determining drawing power should not be older than three months;
(4) The outstanding in the account based on drawing power calculated from stock statements older than three months, shall be deemed as irregular.

