(1) An LAB’s investments in all types of instruments listed at paragraph 19(2) below, which are issued by other banks / FIs and are eligible for capital status for the investee bank / FI, shall be limited to 10 per cent of the investing LAB’s total regulatory capital (Tier 1 plus Tier 2 Capital).
