Implementation of auto-escalation of the partially resolved or wholly rejected complaints to the office of the IO within the timelines;
Action taken by the office of the IO with regard to analysis of complaints, reports submitted to the Reserve Bank of India and the bank, raising awareness of the staff of the bank about the grievance redressal processes, and such other processes;
