“Non-Banking Financial Company” shall have the same meaning as assigned to it in Section 45-I (f) of the Act; and
“Stock Broker Connect” shall mean a mechanism through which a stock broker provides access to NDS-OM to its individual constituents / clients maintaining demat accounts with depositories registered with the Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI).
